Third-party language data
-------------------------
Dutch spelling forms were validated with the OpenTaal Dutch word list.
Creator: Stichting OpenTaal.
Source: https://github.com/OpenTaal/opentaal-wordlist
License: Revised BSD License and/or CC BY 3.0.
A copy of the applicable license is included in data/OpenTaal-LICENSE.txt.

The verb atlas is an adaptation generated from curated verb roots, morphological
rules and spelling validation; it is not a reproduction of Van Dale content.

Pattern Dutch verb morphology
-----------------------------
The file data/sources/pattern-nl-verbs.txt is derived from the Dutch verb
resource distributed with Pattern by the University of Antwerp. It is used
only as a morphology comparison source for the manually written core review.
Pattern is distributed under the BSD 3-Clause license. A copy is included in
data/Pattern-LICENSE.txt.
Source repository: https://github.com/clips/pattern

Supplied pedagogical photographs
--------------------------------
The 57 supplied reference photographs are not redistributed in this project.
They were used only to audit topic coverage. New explanations, examples,
answers and exercises in js/source-review-content.js were written independently.


A1 reference expansion (October 2026)
The 90 newly supplied textbook photographs are reference material only and are
not redistributed in this repository. Third-party text, photographs, illustrations
and maps retain their original rights; the course license does not relicense them.
The A1 Cheat Sheet contains independently written summaries and examples and
reuses existing course illustrations. Existing audio and credits remain unchanged.
Speech synthesis uses the user's available system voices.

Alpha 14 A1 course expansion
The 32 additional lessons, 12 new verb entries and 120 exercises are original
educational text. Existing course images are reused with their original credits.
New listening controls use Dutch browser speech synthesis; no book recordings
or third-party audio files are copied. The reference photographs are not bundled.
